### KnowledgeForge Code Architecture API
### Use with IntelliJ HTTP Client:
### docker run --rm -i -t -v $PWD:/workdir jetbrains/intellij-http-client sources/Api/http/code_architecture.http

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000
@apiKey = test-api-key-12345

### Get latest architecture
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/code/architecture
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

### Export latest architecture as Structurizr DSL
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/code/architecture/export/structurizr
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

### Export latest architecture as Mermaid C4 snippet
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/code/architecture/export/mermaid
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

### Trigger extraction from GitHub
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/code/extract-from-github
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "github_url": "https://github.com/microservices-demo/microservices-demo",
  "use_git": true,
  "append_mode": true,
  "max_components_per_domain": 10
}

